{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Save the next hit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Music is the most valuable asset in the world, and hard drives filled with unreleased tracks have been stolen by a gang that wants to monopolize the charts. It's up to you to recover them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as Tina &amp; Tunner \u2014 she's the best getaway driver in the hood, he's a sharpshooter with perfect aim. Together, this couple uses their unique talents in high-octane missions, combining action and rhythm in a race against time to save the art that moves the world: music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Fast-paced gameplay focused on driving and shootouts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Vibrant visuals with a strong urban identity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Original soundtrack by rapper NP Vocal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Charismatic characters and a story inspired by street culture</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Missions full of action, chases, and musical challenges</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1795630?t=1748977975","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1795630/6ff691c112d53e8caf48167ae58f90f5dcb7044a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748977975","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1795630/3a25fc4484f1f8ae2990eae452aa3d214a02a38e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748977975","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1795630/3a25fc4484f1f8ae2990eae452aa3d214a02a38e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748977975","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descript